OL,3,GNEWSALittlewoods project backed despite
OL,4,Astudios pull-out
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company behind plans to regenerate
OL,7,FLiverpool's landmark Littlewoods
OL,8,Fbuilding said the project was still on
OL,9,Ftrack despite proposals to bring a film
OL,10,Fstudio to the site falling through.
OL,12,FCapital & Centric - which has been
OL,13,Finvolved with the Edge Lane site for
OL,14,Fmore than a decade - confirmed that
OL,15,FTwickenham Studios was no longer going
OL,16,Fto be involved.
OL,18,FThere had been plans to turn the famous
OL,19,FArt Deco building into a "Hollywood of
OL,20,Fthe North" film production and
OL,21,Fpost-production complex.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
