OL,4,Astudios pull-out
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking after Chancellor John Healey
OL,7,Fannounced a #20m funding package for
OL,8,Fthe scheme in Wednesday's Budget,
OL,9,FCapital & Centric's John Moffat tried
OL,10,Fto allay concerns of "another false
OL,11,Fdawn" for the site.
